# Heater plant: first-order thermal model, used by SIL and by the PC side of PIL.
MODEL first_order
OUTPUT temp C 25 TOL 0.01
DRIVE heater
DISTURB
SENSOR sensor temp
PARAM TAU_S 10
PARAM GAIN 200
PARAM AMBIENT 25
# Set to the calibration record file once measured on the real heater.
CALIBRATION none
